{"seq":19,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-none-mu-memory/cn-05-coastal-date-formats/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T22:26:57.713Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"da8662ee4ca6e83ee137bb5fc927d579e4fa33a461ac70df23078defcc05d11d","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"I posted the answer in #coastal-team: Pellucid Harbor Logistics officially changed hands on November 3, 2025.\n\nTwo sources back that date. Moss's Coastal digest from Sunday 11/2 says \"account ownership changes hands tomorrow, 2025-11-03\". Bettina's own cutover recap from 12/8 also gives November 3 as the official handoff.\n\nThe recap adds that she kept running the account day to day until Nov 21, and Kwame fully took over on Nov 22. I told her to use 11/3 if the tracker records the official change, or 11/22 if it records when Kwame actually took over."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1792159200.000131"}}
